1. INTRODUCTION & OVERVIEW
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Welcome to BlitzApp. BlitzApp is an independent personal project created to 
help players and teams discover and coordinate reservations with local football 
stadiums and game centers.

This is a personal, non-commercial developer project operated without a 
registered corporate or business entity. This Privacy Policy transparently 
explains what minimal data is collected, how it is handled to coordinate sports 
bookings, and how you retain full control over your personal data.

Transparent & Minimal Data Practices:
We only collect information strictly required to create your account and 
coordinate sports reservations. We do not track your activity across other apps, 
display behavioral advertisements, or sell your personal data.


2. INFORMATION WE COLLECT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
We collect information directly provided by you during account registration, 
profile management, venue management, and reservation booking:

* Account Credentials & Profile:
  Your full name, a unique username (used as your primary login identifier), 
  and your password. Passwords are cryptographically hashed using server-side 
  bcrypt before storage. You may optionally upload a profile picture.

* Booking & Reservation Data:
  When reserving a stadium or game center slot, we store the venue ID, scheduled 
  date, time slot, hourly fee in Iraqi Dinars (IQD), reservation status (active, 
  pending, accepted, denied, cancelled), and any cancellation notes provided.

* Venue Information (Managers Only):
  If you list a stadium or game center, we store your venue name, neighborhood/
  city description, hourly pricing, amenities/games offered, venue photos, and 
  operating schedule.

* In-App Notifications:
  Status updates, booking notices, cancellation alerts, and administrative 
  warnings are generated and stored directly in our application database. We do 
  not collect or store external push notification device tokens (such as Apple 
  APNs or Firebase Cloud Messaging tokens).

* Data We Do NOT Collect:
  We do NOT collect credit/debit card numbers, bank account credentials, 
  continuous background GPS location, phone numbers for registration/login, OTP 
  codes, advertising identifiers, or biometric data.


3. PASSWORD & ACCOUNT SECURITY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Your account authentication is built on industry-standard security principles:

* Bcrypt Hashing:
  All passwords are transformed with strong one-way cryptographic hashing 
  (bcrypt) before ever being written to the database. Plaintext passwords are 
  never stored, logged, or visible to anyone, including platform administrators.

* Encrypted Transmission:
  All communications between the mobile application and the backend API take 
  place over secure HTTPS / TLS encrypted channels.

* Token-Based Authentication:
  Protected API endpoints use cryptographically random Laravel Sanctum bearer 
  tokens. Tokens are securely stored on your device and can be instantly 
  invalidated upon logout or account deletion.

* Login Rate Limiting:
  To protect accounts against automated brute-force attacks, the login endpoint 
  enforces rate limiting (maximum 5 attempts per minute per account/IP).


4. LOCATION DATA & GOOGLE MAPS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Accurate venue discovery is essential for sports bookings. Location data is 
handled under strict, feature-specific boundaries:

* Customers (Players & Teams):
  The mobile application does NOT request, access, or record your physical 
  device GPS location. Customers browse venues by listed neighborhoods and cities 
  without transmitting device coordinates to our servers.

* Venue Managers (Stadium & Center Operators):
  Managers may capture their venue's geographic pin (latitude, longitude, and 
  accuracy radius) using their device's GPS during venue setup or update. This GPS 
  reading occurs ONLY upon an explicit button tap. Continuous background GPS 
  tracking is never executed.

* Permanent Storage of Coordinates:
  Only the resulting venue map coordinates (latitude and longitude) are 
  permanently stored in the database to display the stadium or game center pin on 
  the map. The manager's personal device location is not tracked thereafter.

* Google Maps Integration:
  We integrate Google Maps to allow managers to verify their venue pin and allow 
  customers to view venue locations and open turn-by-turn directions in their 
  external Google Maps app. Interactions with Google Maps are governed by the 
  Google Privacy Policy (https://policies.google.com/privacy).


5. HOW WE USE YOUR INFORMATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Information collected is used solely for legitimate platform functionality:

* Account Authentication:
  Creating accounts, authenticating logins with unique usernames and passwords, 
  and maintaining secure login sessions.

* Booking Coordination:
  Allocating time slots, preventing double-bookings with atomic database locks, 
  and routing booking confirmations or cancellation notices between players and 
  venue operators.

* Venue Listing & Discovery:
  Displaying venue descriptions, pricing in IQD, slot availability, and map pins 
  to prospective sports players.

* Platform Administration & Quality Control:
  Reviewing no-show reports, resolving booking cancellations, issuing 
  administrative notices, and calculating internal 3% platform service fees for 
  registered venue operators.

* Abuse Prevention & Security:
  Preventing spam bookings, enforcing temporary bans against abusive accounts, 
  and protecting API endpoints against unauthorized access.


6. PAYMENTS & FINANCIAL TRANSACTIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
BlitzApp coordinates reservations and schedules but does NOT operate an integrated 
digital payment gateway:

* Customer On-Site Payments:
  Customers pay venue operators directly on-site at the sports facility 
  (typically in cash in Iraqi Dinars upon arrival) or through private arrangements 
  agreed between the customer and the venue operator. No payment card numbers, 
  bank accounts, or financial transactions are collected or processed by BlitzApp.

* Venue Platform Fees:
  Registered venue operators are subject to an internal 3% platform commission 
  on completed customer reservations, which is tracked and reconciled 
  administratively with platform operations.


7. DATA SHARING & DISCLOSURE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
We do not sell, rent, lease, or trade personal data to third parties. Data is 
shared only in the following direct operational contexts:

* Between Customers and Venue Managers:
  When a reservation is created, the customer's name, username, and reserved 
  time slot are shared with the venue manager to facilitate venue access. 
  Similarly, the manager's venue details and location are displayed to the 
  customer.

* Technical Infrastructure Providers:
  We utilize trusted hosting and technical service providers (Hostinger cloud 
  hosting and Google Maps API) strictly to run the backend and map rendering.

* Legal Compliance:
  We may disclose data only if strictly required by applicable law, lawful 
  authority request, or to prevent malicious fraud and protect physical safety.


8. DATA RETENTION & ACCOUNT DELETION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
We retain personal information only for as long as your account remains active 
and as needed for platform integrity:

* Active Accounts:
  Your profile details, username, favorites, and notifications are stored while 
  your account remains active.

* Self-Service Account Deletion:
  You may permanently delete your account at any time directly through the mobile 
  application (Profile > Legal & Compliance > Delete Account) using password 
  confirmation or typing DELETE.

* Erasure Scope:
  Upon account deletion, your name, username, profile picture file, password 
  hash, active sessions, authentication tokens, favorites, and personal 
  notifications are permanently deleted or anonymized. Any upcoming active 
  reservations are automatically cancelled and freed for other players.

* Retained Anonymous Records:
  Completed past booking transactions are detached from your personal identity 
  and retained anonymously to maintain venue financial accounting and platform fee 
  auditing.


9. USER RIGHTS & DATA CONTROLS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
You have full control over your personal data within the application:

* Access & Update:
  You can review and update your name, username, and password at any time in 
  Profile > Personal Details.

* Language Preferences:
  You can switch your interface language between English and Central Kurdish 
  (کوردی) at any time.

* Device Permissions:
  You can grant or revoke Camera, Photo Library, and Location permissions at any 
  time through your mobile device's operating system settings.

* Account Erasure:
  You have the unqualified right to permanently delete your account directly 
  inside the mobile application without needing to contact support.


10. CHILDREN'S PRIVACY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
BlitzApp is designed for general audiences who are capable of reserving sports 
venues (typically individuals aged 13 or older).

We do not knowingly collect personal data from children under 13 without parental 
consent. If you become aware that a child under 13 has created an account without 
parental consent, please contact us at blitz.platform.app@gmail.com so the account 
and associated data can be promptly removed.


